7.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Protect this window first, and a lot of the rest gets easier.","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"Continue","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"27 · Your Starting Point","label":"Starting Score","items":[{"t":"YOUR RECOVERY SCORE","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"412","fs":60,"fw":600},{"t":"of 3,000","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"This is not a grade — just where you start. It can move.","fs":14.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"28 · The Next 30 Days","label":"Cost Next 30","items":[{"t":"This is your next 30 days","fs":26,"fw":500},{"t":"At the rate you reported, about 9 of the next 30 days end the same way.","fs":14.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"29 · One Year From Now","label":"Cost Next 365","items":[{"t":"A year at this pace — about 110 days","fs":15,"fw":500},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"30 · If Nothing Changes","label":"Cost By Age 80","items":[{"t":"By age 80 — about 6,100 days","fs":15,"fw":500},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"31 · Change the Line","label":"Change the Line","items":[{"t":"You don’t have to fix the next year tonight.","fs":26,"fw":500},{"t":"You only have to make the next decision different. Then again tomorrow. That is how the line changes.","fs":14.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Start changing it","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"32 · One Bad Day","label":"One Bad Day","items":[{"t":"One bad day is one bad day.","fs":24,"fw":500},{"t":"A bad day does not erase the work before it. Your lessons, logs, and medallions stay.","fs":14,"fw":400},{"t":"slip","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"slip","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"day 0","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"today · day 41","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"Continue","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"33 · What You Want Back","label":"What You Want Back","items":[{"t":"The goal is not a long streak.","fs":24,"fw":500},{"t":"You said porn gets in the way of your focus, sleep, and confidence. These twelve weeks are about taking those back.","fs":14,"fw":400},{"t":"how hard urges pull","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"week I","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"week XII","fs":15,"fw":400},{"t":"See the twelve weeks","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"34 · Twelve Weeks — I–IV","label":"Campaign Map","items":[{"t":"Your twelve weeks.","fs":22,"fw":500},{"t":"Week IV","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Know Your Brain","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Week III","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"In the Moment","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Week II","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Changing Your Mindset","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Week I","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"You are here","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Reset","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"35 · Twelve Weeks — V–VIII","label":"Campaign Map II","items":[{"t":"Your twelve weeks.","fs":22,"fw":500},{"t":"Week VIII","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Boredom and Meaning","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Week VII","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Relapse and Adversity","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Week VI","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Discipline","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Week V","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Why It Feels Worth It","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Next","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"36 · Twelve Weeks — IX–XII","label":"Campaign Map III","items":[{"t":"Your twelve weeks.","fs":22,"fw":500},{"t":"Week XII","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Leave It Behind","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Week XI","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Build a Life You Want","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Week X","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Yourself","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Week IX","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Connection","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Continue","fs":17,"fw":600},{"t":"By week XII, the aim is simple: porn takes up less of your time, attention, and headspace.","fs":14,"fw":400}]},{"badge":"37 · A Letter Arrived","label":"Letter Received","items":[{"t":"A letter arrived.","fs":24,"fw":500},{"t":"From you, twelve weeks from now.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Open it","fs":17,"fw":600},{"t":"Save it for later","fs":15,"fw":500}]},{"badge":"38 · A Letter From Week XII","label":"Letter Week XII","items":[{"t":"Sam —","fs":18,"fw":600},{"t":"I’m writing this at the end of week XII.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"I remember where you are right now. You want this to be the time it finally changes, but part of you is already wondering how long you’ll last. I was thinking the same thing.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"So here is the part I wish you knew: you do not need twelve perfect weeks. You need to stop turning one bad night into a reason to quit.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"There were nights when I wanted to watch badly. Some days the only thing I did right was get through the evening. That still counted.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"And there were bad days. What changed was what happened after them. I stopped saying “I’ve ruined it now, so what is the point?” I came back the next morning. I logged what happened. I carried on.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"At the start, porn still felt like the quickest relief when I was bored, stressed, lonely, or fed up. That did not disappear in a week. But every time I waited one out, left the room, or used the SOS instead, I learned the same thing: the urge ends whether you obey it or not.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"After a while, that changes you. You stop being scared of an urge because you have seen enough of them come and go. You stop treating every difficult night like an emergency. You start trusting yourself again.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"The biggest difference is not a streak. It is waking up without the feeling that you gave another night away. It is having more time and attention for the things you said you wanted back.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"I am not going to tell you everything is fixed here. It is not. I still have bad days. I still get urges. They are just not running the whole show anymore.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"If you are reading this on day 0, do not try to get to week XII tonight. Get through tonight. Tomorrow, come back. If you slip, do not disappear for a week because you are embarrassed. Come back the next morning.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"That is how you make it out: you keep coming back long enough for things to change.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Hard nights end. Urges end. Bad days end. None of them has to be the day you give up. Do not quit on yourself halfway through. I’ll see you at week XII.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"— Sam, at week XII","fs":16,"fw":600},{"t":"Keep this letter","fs":16.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Continue","fs":14.5,"fw":500}]},{"badge":"39 · The Vow","label":"The Vow","items":[{"t":"The vow.","fs":22,"fw":500},{"t":"I’m giving this twelve weeks. I don’t need to be perfect. When it gets hard, I’ll use the plan before I give in. If I have a bad day, I’ll come back the next day.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Sam","fs":44,"fw":400},{"t":"×","fs":14,"fw":400},{"t":"Jun 9 · Day 0","fs":12,"fw":500},{"t":"I sign it","fs":17,"fw":600},{"t":"Not now","fs":15,"fw":500}]},{"badge":"40 · Medallion Earned","label":"Medallion Received","items":[{"t":"MEDALLION EARNED","fs":11,"fw":600},{"t":"V","fs":17,"fw":600},{"t":"Veni","fs":27,"fw":600},{"t":"Tier I","fs":12.5,"fw":600},{"t":"You started.","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Take it","fs":17,"fw":600}]},{"badge":"41 · Reminders","label":"Reminders Setup","items":[{"t":"Late night is when you’re most likely to watch.","fs":22,"fw":500},{"t":"Want VICI there before that window starts?","fs":15.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Morning check-in","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"now","fs":12.5,"fw":500},{"t":"Twenty seconds — where's your head at today?","fs":14.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Late night ahead","fs":15.5,"fw":600},{"t":"10:41 PM","fs":12.5,"fw":500},{"t":"Your risky window. The wave tool is one tap away.","fs":14.5,"fw":400},{"t":"Turn on reminders","fs":17,"fw":600},{"t":"Not now","fs":15,"fw":500}]},{"badge":"42 · Paywall","label":"Free Trial Paywall","items":[{"t":"Restore","fs":14,"fw":500},{"t":"VICI","fs":15,"fw":500},{"t":"PLUS","fs":10.5,"fw":600},{"t":"Give it twelve weeks","fs":28,"fw":500},{"t":"Yearly","fs":15,"fw":500},{"t":"Best value","fs":12.5,"fw":500}